Condition : 7 - Prior to the first occupation of the development, full details (including manufacturer's specifications and means of enclosure) of the cycle parking provision for the development shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. 
The approved details shall conform to current guidance such as the West London Cycle Parking Guidance in design and layout, and in particular shall demonstrate:
"	A minimum of 1m space between each parallel Sheffield-Style Stand;
"	Aisle width and door access width of at least 1.2m wide;
"	Inward opening doors.
The approved details shall be fully implemented and made available for use before the first occupation of the development hereby approved and thereafter permanently retained for use at all times without obstruction.
